flowchart LR
    Client[API caller] -->|Authenticated order| ERP[ERP API]
    ERP -->|One SQL transaction| ED[(SourceOrder and OutboxMessage)]
    ED --> Worker[Single delivery worker]
    Worker -->|HTTP outside SQL transaction| WMS[WMS API]
    WMS -->|One SQL transaction| WD[(AcceptedOrder and AcceptanceReceipt)]
    WD -->|Original receipt for duplicates| WMS
    WMS -->|Acceptance receipt| Worker
    Worker -->|Persist outcome and attempt| ED
